WEBVTT


00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:01.539
Hello, I'm Willie Anderson,

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.540
Jonathan’s father, and we are here at,

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:05.160
Jonathan's show in,

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.940
Paris for the ladies

00:00:06.941 --> 00:00:08.979
What's one message you would give to your son?

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.340
I just wanna say we wish him all the best today

00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:12.540
And we're very proud of him

00:00:13.706 --> 00:00:14.823
He’s a genius
